      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**প্রতিজ্ঞা ৪.** $x - a$ যদি $P(x)$ বহুপদীর একটি উৎপাদক হয়, তবে $P(a) = 0$ হবে।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "x - a",
        "P(x)",
        "P(a) = 0"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 49,
