    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.9-p002",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**প্রমাণ:** যেহেতু $x - a$, $P(x)$ বহুপদীর একটি উৎপাদক, সুতরাং আরেকটি বহুপদী $Q(x)$ পাওয়া যায় যেন $P(x) = (x - a)Q(x)$।\nএখানে $x = a$ বসিয়ে দেখা যায় যে, $P(a) = (a - a)Q(a) = 0 \\cdot Q(a) = 0$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "x - a",
        "P(x)",
        "Q(x)",
        "P(x) = (x - a)Q(x)",
        "x = a",
        "P(a) = (a - a)Q(a) = 0 \\cdot Q(a) = 0"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 49,
      "pdfPageEnd": 49,
      "printedPageStart": 44,
      "printedPageEnd": 44,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
